Name: jmap_push_types
Type: BITFIELD
Allowed-Values: Mailbox Thread Email EmailDelivery Identity EmailSubmission VacationResponse Quota SieveScript Principal ShareNotification AddressBook ContactCard Calendar CalendarEvent CalendarEventNotification ParticipantIdentity Note
Default-Value: Mailbox Thread Email EmailDelivery EmailSubmission AddressBook ContactCard Calendar CalendarEvent
Last-Modified: UNRELEASED

JMAP data types that a PushSubscription may list in its "types" property.
Cyrus doesn't send the pushes itself, so this should match the types the
notification service handling PushSubscriptionCreated events can push.
